      "text": "## 1. Statistical Language Models"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Language model**: assigns probability to sequences of words. Core task: compute P(w₁, w₂, ..., wT)."
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Chain rule**:\n```\n  P(w₁,...,wT) = Π_{t=1}^T P(wₜ | w₁,...,wₜ₋₁)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**n-gram model**: Markov assumption — only last (n-1) words matter:\n```\n  P(wₜ | w₁,...,wₜ₋₁) ≈ P(wₜ | wₜ₋ₙ₊₁,...,wₜ₋₁) = C(wₜ₋ₙ₊₁,...,wₜ) / C(wₜ₋ₙ₊₁,...,wₜ₋₁)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Unigram (n=1): P(w) = C(w)/N\n  Bigram  (n=2): P(wₜ | wₜ₋₁) = C(wₜ₋₁wₜ) / C(wₜ₋₁)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Data sparsity problem**: C(unseen n-gram) = 0 → P = 0 → product = 0. Need smoothing."
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Kneser-Ney smoothing** (best practical n-gram):\n```\n  P_{KN}(w|context) = max(C(context, w) - d, 0) / C(context)\n                     + λ(context) · P_{KN-lower}(w | shorter context)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "d ≈ 0.75 (discount)\n  λ: normalizing constant\n  P_{KN-lower}: recursively smoothed lower-order model"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Innovation: continuation probability — P_continuation(w) ∝ # contexts w completes\n  \"San Francisco\" → Francisco has high continuation (many contexts precede it)\n  Better than uniform backoff.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Perplexity**: standard metric for language models:\n```\n  PP(W) = P(w₁,...,wT)^{-1/T} = exp(-(1/T) Σ log P(wₜ | w₁:ₜ₋₁))\n  = exp(cross-entropy of model on test set)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Lower PP = better model. PP=k means model is \"k-way confused\" at each step.\n  Intuition: branching factor — if all words equally likely at each step, PP = vocab size.\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#015",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
