      },
      "text": "## Information Retrieval Bridge — TF-IDF → Distributional Semantics"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#017",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Any practitioner who has built search knows TF-IDF and cosine similarity. Distributional\nsemantics is the same mathematical idea applied to word co-occurrence rather than\ndocument-term co-occurrence:"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#018",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "data-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nInformation retrieval (search)              Distributional semantics (NLP)\n──────────────────────────────────────      ──────────────────────────────────────────\nTerm-document matrix M ∈ ℝ^{|V|×|D|}       Word-context matrix M ∈ ℝ^{|V|×|V|}\n  Mᵢⱼ = frequency of term i in doc j         Mᵢⱼ = count(word i near word j in corpus)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#019",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
        "canonical_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "current_path": "data-science/16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:data-science:nlp-foundations",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
