        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TF-IDF(i, j) = tf(i,j) · idf(i)            PPMI(w, c) = max(log P(w,c)/P(w)P(c), 0)\n  tf = local term frequency                   Both re-weight raw counts to reduce\n  idf = -log(df_i / N) (rare terms↑)          domination by high-frequency terms\n  → both suppress common words               → idf and PMI serve the same role:\n  → both boost rare, distinctive terms         penalize high-frequency co-occurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#020",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
