        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BM25 (Okapi BM25): better than TF-IDF       PPMI with context distribution smoothing\n  Saturates tf beyond a threshold k₁          Analogous saturation of raw counts\n  Normalizes for doc length (param b)          Context window size plays similar role\n  → more robust to long documents            → both are parameterized re-weightings"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#021",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
