        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Cosine similarity of TF-IDF vectors:        Cosine similarity of word vectors:\n  sim(doc_i, doc_j) = u·v / (‖u‖‖v‖)         sim(word_i, word_j) = u·v / (‖u‖‖v‖)\n  Documents with similar vocabulary           Words appearing in similar contexts\n  are considered similar                      are considered semantically similar"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#022",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:data-science:16-nlp-foundations, git-history:data-science:16-nlp-foundations]",
