        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SVD on TF-IDF matrix (LSA):                 SVD on PPMI matrix:\n  Latent Semantic Analysis (Deerwester 1990)   Word2Vec = specific PPMI factorization\n  Reduces |D|-dimensional doc vectors          Reduces |V|-dimensional word vectors\n  to k-dimensional topic vectors              to d-dimensional semantic vectors\n  → same mathematical operation              → Word2Vec = fast LSA (Levy & Goldberg 2014)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#023",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
