        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Query expansion via semantic similarity:     Synonym detection via word vectors:\n  Use LSA similarity to expand queries        cos(vec(car), vec(automobile)) ≈ 0.9\n  with related terms → better recall         → structurally identical task\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#024",
      "path": [
