      },
      "text": "**The unified view**: TF-IDF, PPMI, BM25, and Word2Vec are all weighted co-occurrence\nstatistics processed with dimensionality reduction. The IR community discovered\nthe mathematical framework; NLP adapted it to word-word co-occurrence and then\nreplaced the matrix factorization with neural prediction (Word2Vec) for efficiency."
    },
