        "root_concepts": "[nlp, foundations]",
        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Word-context matrix**: count co-occurrences within a window:\n```\n  M ∈ ℝ^{|V| × |V|}:  M_{ij} = count(wordᵢ appears in context of wordⱼ)"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#029",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
