        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "NLP Foundations",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Problem: raw counts dominated by function words (the, a, of...)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md#030",
      "path": [
        "16-NLP-FOUNDATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
